# Sidecar binaries — regenerated locally by `bun run build:sidecar`
# (called from `dev`/`build` scripts in package.json) and consumed by
# tauri.conf.json externalBin. Keeping them in git only churns binary
# diffs after every codesign and bloats history.
src-tauri/binaries/*-aarch64-apple-darwin
src-tauri/binaries/*-x86_64-apple-darwin
